    accrual: "Depends on claim type. TORT (ex delicto): from the date of JUDICIAL DEMAND (filing of suit) per R.S. 13:4203, mandatory. CONTRACT / sum of money: from the time the sum is DUE (which may predate suit) per Civ. Code art. 2000.",
